(normally r-assign-vocab-docs (and ready-vocab-docs agent-claude-available) assign-to-vocab-docs-claude)
(normally r-assign-vocab-view (and ready-vocab-view agent-claude-available) assign-to-vocab-view-claude)
(normally r-assign-vocab-cli (and ready-vocab-cli agent-claude-available) assign-to-vocab-cli-claude)
